  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDD+ phase II Investment of the result based payment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia is moving from REDD+ phase I to phase II of the climate partnership agreement where Ethiopia will work on the investment protifolio to achieve results(carbon emission reductions).</narrative>
  </description>
